# Retired: nights-watch run state moved to .agents/nights-watch/ and is
# covered by the wholesale line below. These four stay for one release so a
# clone written by the previous version keeps its logs ignored during the
# fallback window (docs/agent-state.md, Retired paths). Delete them after.
# .nights-watch/library/ is a deliverable and stays tracked either way.
.nights-watch/JOURNAL.md
.nights-watch/journal.md
.nights-watch/chronicles/
.nights-watch/locks/
.nights-watch/hunts/

# Skill run logs and operational state (docs/agent-state.md). Wholesale --
# no deliverable ever lives under .agents/, so no per-path opt-in is needed.
.agents/
